<title>UK: Courtaulds Textiles up on Warburg comments.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds Textiles up on Warburg comments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Courtaulds Textiles Plc rose nine pence to 282-1/2 pence after SBC Warburg reiterated its buy recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>The broker believed the shares were attractive and had fair recovery potential, dealers added.</p>
<p>Shares in Courtaulds Textiles have been in a cautious up-trend since Janary after hitting a 12-month low of 226 pence on December 18.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
